Import "../Engineering.lingua"

Connect operating evidence to the major engineering disciplines (@engineering-operation-branches: 0, is #chapter, #hephaestus-core "Investigate-operating-state-observation-and-handover-on-a-finite-card-board.lingua#r_004C8B3546F6B259002ECC6C21") { r_00E446205CFF984E3AE1329789
The shared core supplies a way to connect intended function, quantities, realization, observation, people and continuing service. Major disciplines specialize the material models, constraints, instruments and evidence. Use the following connections to enter them without assuming a completed branch from a familiar equation.

| Major branch | Shared preparation to reuse | New branch premises and evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Civil and built systems | geometry, equilibrium, compatibility, ports and service requirements | ground and water conditions, structural systems, construction sequence, environmental exposure, inspection and occupancy/use |
| Chemical and process engineering | species/material balances, phase and energy accounts, kinetics, transport and feedback | process-specific material behavior, equipment scales and interfaces, separation/reaction realization, operating envelopes and domain-specific safeguards |
| Materials engineering | structure/property relations, mechanical response, thermal/chemical histories and measurement | processing-dependent structure, joining and surface effects, degradation, variability and evidence for the actual material state |
| Mechanical and electrical systems | motion, load/energy paths, circuits, control and service | physical components, residual states, installation, interfaces, faults, maintenance and verified intended operation |
| Production engineering | accepted output, resource visits, waiting spaces, schedules, rework and service | process selection, material flow, equipment and people, capacity, quality, maintainability and recovery across a real production system |

Reuse [Define the boundary ports and stored quantities before a balance](Define-the-boundary-ports-and-stored-quantities-before-a-balance.lingua#r_007A17F7243A9F54EDDD173BA3), [Review material response compatibility and realization evidence](Review-material-response-compatibility-and-realization-evidence.lingua#r_00BDADE402F09A1363C7851E3C), [Review phase equilibrium with conservation stability and material evidence](../../chemistry/core/Review-phase-equilibrium-with-conservation-stability-and-material-evidence.lingua#r_00AC7BC9CDA367232B59350893), [Review feedback requirements dynamics and realization evidence](Review-feedback-requirements-dynamics-and-realization-evidence.lingua#r_003878F402F646426D07E046F6) and [Review useful output resource visits and production evidence](Review-useful-output-resource-visits-and-production-evidence.lingua#r_0020116EB91E4F3F0E82819ED1) at the exact dependency that needs them. Existing [Mechanical engineering and machine design — useful mechanisms and continuing service](../mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R), [Materials engineering — structure, processing and useful behavior](../materials-engineering/Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9) and [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618) provide deeper developed material; a learner need not finish all of them before asking a common operating question. Earth/ground premises connect to the [Gaia Earth entrance](../../../gaia/earth/Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH); the reference does not complete geology or a civil-engineering programme.

Compare a common evidence error across disciplines. A command to start a transfer is not an observed mass flow. A nominal material grade is not the measured condition of a processed component. A recorded inspection is not proof that every later environmental condition is acceptable. A completed production count is not accepted output unless the acceptance conditions are met. The common pattern is to connect the claim to the relevant physical observation and its limitations, then develop the specific theory and practice in the branch.

**Work:** choose two branches and map the same paper-model roles to their questions. Name where the analogy stops. Identify an actual shared Record, one missing branch premise and a meaningful future observation for each. Keep clean manufacturing within production engineering: cleanliness is one process/quality requirement alongside flow, capacity, equipment, operation and recovery. Do not open another specialist leaf while the remaining common mathematics and physics gaps are being developed.

**Continue:** [Investigate operating state observation and handover on a finite card board](Investigate-operating-state-observation-and-handover-on-a-finite-card-board.lingua#r_004C8B3546F6B259002ECC6C21).

**Return:** [Engineering](../Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68).
